1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
O felix Roma!
O felix Roma nobilis!

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,000
O felix Roma!
Roma felix, Roma nobilis!

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Sedes es Petri,
Qui Christi vicem gerit!

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:41,800
Sedes es Petri,
Qui apostolus est pacis!

5
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Pontifex,
Tecum erimus omnes nos!

6
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Pontifex,
Es magister qui tuos confirmas fratres!

7
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Pontifex,
Tecum erimus omnes nos!

8
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Pontifex,
Es magister qui tuos confirmas fratres!

9
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Pontifex,
Fundamentum ac robur nostrum,

10
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Petre, tu es Christi,
Es vicarius super terram!

11
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:58,800
Rupes inter fluctus,
Tu es pharus ac veritas!

12
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Tu Christi es charitas,
Tu es unitatis custos!